>                          "Contemporaneous weather controls (Mar-Nov, year t)" 
> ///
>                          "Age shares")) ///
>             prehead("% Table 1. Outcome = $YLAB." ///
>                     "% Generated by regression_log_harvest.do. SEs clustered o
> n county." ///
